ement\n- Peak performance coaching\n\nOur goal is for MOOD to house the most comprehensive library of mental well-being instructional content anywhere in the world\n\nNEW FEATURES IN THIS VERSION\n\n- Get to know more about the practitioners that are guiding you.\n- Find an experience that better suits you by filtering based on meditation categories.\n- Discover new practitioners joining our community and collaborating with us.\n- Now we have the ability to post brand new experiences every week.\n\nGive us your feedback!  Email us: info@moonshot.la", "short_description": "ACHIEVE PEACE OF MIND IN 10 MINUTES OR LESS\nMaster your mental state with MOOD\u2019s one-of-a-kind virtual reality experiences:\n\n- Learn from the most innovative teachers in the world\n- Find the mindset tools that are right for you\n- Choose from an unprecedented variety of practices & techniques"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.moonshot.la/mood-privacy-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Moonshot", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.moonshot.la/mood", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "482015257153052"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031596_1232921150578831_8681388477415419205_n.png?stp=dst-png